{"id":109,"name":"الكافرون","transliteration":"Al-Kafirun","translation_fr":"Les mécréants","translation_en":"The Disbelievers","type":"meccan","total_verses":6,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"قُلۡ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلۡكَٰفِرُونَ","translation_fr":"Dis: «O vous les infidèles","translation_en":"Say, \"O disbelievers","transliteration":"Qul ya ayyuha alkafiroona"},{"id":2,"text":"لَآ أَعۡبُدُ مَا تَعۡبُدُونَ","translation_fr":"Je n'adore pas ce que vous adorez","translation_en":"I do not worship what you worship","transliteration":"La aAAbudu ma taAAbudoona"},{"id":3,"text":"وَلَآ أَنتُمۡ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعۡبُدُ","translation_fr":"Et vous n'êtes pas adorateurs de ce que j'adore","translation_en":"Nor are you worshippers of what I worship","transliteration":"Wala antum AAabidoona ma aAAbudu"},{"id":4,"text":"وَلَآ أَنَا۠ عَابِدٞ مَّا عَبَدتُّمۡ","translation_fr":"Je ne suis pas adorateur de ce que vous adorez","translation_en":"Nor will I be a worshipper of what you worship","transliteration":"Wala ana AAabidun ma AAabadtum"},{"id":5,"text":"وَلَآ أَنتُمۡ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعۡبُدُ","translation_fr":"Et vous n'êtes pas adorateurs de ce que j'adore","translation_en":"Nor will you be worshippers of what I worship","transliteration":"Wala antum AAabidoona ma aAAbudu"},{"id":6,"text":"لَكُمۡ دِينُكُمۡ وَلِيَ دِينِ","translation_fr":"A vous votre religion, et à moi ma religion»","translation_en":"For you is your religion, and for me is my religion","transliteration":"Lakum deenukum waliya deeni"}]}